{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When vector collections expand beyond tens of thousands of items, exact (O(N)) linear scans become a major latency bottleneck for real-time recommendation and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"HNSWIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" actor provides a hierarchical graph-based spatial partitioning index with sub-millisecond query latency and logarithmic (O(\\log N)) search scaling.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Hierarchical Navigable Small World Architecture","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Hierarchical-Navigable-Small-World-Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"HNSW constructs a hierarchy of graph layers:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Top Layers (Sparse)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Contain widely spaced long-range highway edges for rapid coarse geometric routing across distant clusters.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Intermediate Layers"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Progressively decrease edge length while increasing vertex density.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom Layer (Layer 0, Dense)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Contains all indexed vertices connected by dense short-range edges for high-accuracy localized nearest-neighbor refinement.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Layer 2 (Express):   [A] ───────────────────────────► [F]","                      